@startuml as_is
title AS-IS (2026-09-10) — layer-first; nobody owns a bounded context\nMeasured on src/: 664 .py files / 74,371 lines

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220

package "Composition root" #LightGray {
  component "binance_bot_module.py\n**750 lines**\n~30 singleton + ~40 bind\n+ 16 registry.register\n(persistence + exchange + trading\n+ backtest + strategy + indicator)" as BotModule #Pink
  component "app_bootstrapper.py (547)\n**hard-coded** tuple of 5 modules :322-330\nseed_app_theme() :225\nset_environment_banner_factory() :230" as Boot #Pink
}

package "Screens (presentation/ui/screens) — 25,349 lines" {
  component "trading\n2,458 lines / 9 files" as Trading #LightYellow
  component "dashboard (Dev Board)\n5,005 lines / 15 files\ndashboard_presenter **2,008 lines**\ndev_board_panel 1,015" as Dashboard #LightYellow
  component "backtest\n12,309 lines / 60 files\nbacktest_presenter 1,780" as Backtest #LightYellow
  component "data_management\n4,238 lines / 22 files" as DataMgmt #LightYellow
  component "settings\n1,339 lines / 6 files" as Settings #LightYellow
}

Trading <-[#Red,thickness=4]-> Dashboard : **59 duplicated method names**\n26 Presenter methods\n+ 26 ViewModel members\n+ 7 View fragments\n(verbatim: trading_presenter.py:628-700\n<-> dashboard_presenter.py:1247-1300)

package "presentation/ui/common — 25 files / 2,015 lines" #LightGray {
  component "**Used only by dashboard+trading** (9 items)\norder_feed / equity_feed / signal_feed\nmarket_tick_feed / order_fill_marker\nequity_chart_adapter\nlive_order_book_coordinator\nexecute_order_block_reason\nstrategy_arming_coordinator (392)" as CommonTrading #Pink
  component "Genuinely shared (>=3 screens)\naction_ownership_tracker / app_defaults\nbase_feed / sync_progress_*" as CommonReal #LightGreen
  component "Used by 1 screen only\nbase_event_logger (backtest)\nqml_property (data_mgmt)\nstrategy_display (backtest)" as CommonOne #Pink
}

Trading --> CommonTrading
Dashboard --> CommonTrading
note right of CommonTrading #Pink
  This is **not** "shared UI".
  It is the Trading/Strategy context
  torn in half across 2 screens —
  no module owns it.
end note

package "Layers — split by TECHNICAL KIND" {
  component "domain/ (88 files)\nentities/ value_objects/ events/\npolicies/ models/ indicators/\nstrategies/ scripting/\n---\n**context-shaped:** trading/(13)\nbacktesting/(12)\n**missing:** market_data/\n(scattered over 5 places)" as Domain
  component "application/ (135 files)\nports/(17) services/(15)\nuse_cases/(99) — **already grouped by context**\ntrading/(27) backtest/(15) sync/(8)\nstream/(6) database/(9)\nbut queries/(31) commands/(3) still by kind" as App
  component "infrastructure/ (29 files)\nbinance/(14) persistence/(7)\nengine_adapters/(6) credentials/(2)" as Infra
}

package "Other shared UI" {
  component "qml/ — 17 widget packages, **one flat pile**\n35 .qml, no .qmldir\nno qmlRegisterType\nQQmlEngine created **per QQuickWidget**" as Qml
  component "components/chart_card (27 files)\n**QtWidgets forever** (qml-rule §0)" as Chart
  component "kit/ (28 files, style.py 673)" as Kit
}

Boot --> Trading
Boot --> Dashboard
Boot --> Backtest
Boot --> DataMgmt
Boot --> Settings

Trading ..> App
Dashboard ..> App
Backtest ..> App
DataMgmt ..> App
Settings ..> App
App ..> Domain
Infra ..> App

Backtest -[#Red]-> Infra : **violates §3**\nbacktest_presenter.py:43
Settings -[#Red]-> Infra : **violates §3**\nsettings_presenter.py:21

Trading --> Qml
Dashboard --> Qml
Backtest --> Qml
DataMgmt --> Qml
Trading --> Chart
Dashboard --> Chart
Backtest --> Chart

package "Shared state — nobody owns it" #LightGray {
  component "TradingSessionState\n(trading:234, settings:143, dashboard:534\n+ 3 handlers + websocket thread)" as SessState #Pink
  component "LiveStrategySession\n(trading:300, dashboard:639)" as StratSess #Pink
  component "EquityCurveRecorder\n(trading:237, dashboard:541)" as Equity #Pink
}
BotModule --> SessState
BotModule --> StratSess
BotModule --> Equity
Trading --> SessState
Dashboard --> SessState
Settings --> SessState

note bottom of BotModule #Pink
  EPIC-024C's own words: "there is no notion of a
  'module' for services behind the UI anywhere in the app —
  BinanceBotModule is the ONLY registration point for everything"
end note

note as Symptoms #Pink
  **Bugs that grew out of this**
  BUG-117: nobody owns the positions read model
  BUG-112: Trading depends on Strategy's state
  BOT-126/BUG-085: nobody owns the stream subscription
  EPIC-023A: Dev Board "copy-pasted all six methods"
end note

@enduml
